  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kebbi - Gaskiya Dairy Farmers Capacity Building Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Dairy Beneficiaries: 219 (58 women) Description: In order to be able to find solution to the numerous challenges being faced by the cooperative and increase its sales revenues and improve members incomes, Gaskiya Farmers Cooperative Association is seeking USADF funding assistance to expand its operations...Presently, the methods of production and processing of the milk used by the applicant is traditional, inefficient and has led to low outputs, high wastage and poor economic returns. The project will include a capacity building component in which members would be trained on modern animal husbandry and milking in addition to business management and organizational skills. The association will also establish a milk processing plant for the production of fresh milk into quality processed milk and yogurt. T</narrative>
  </description>
